 * A service mark - the visit a complimentary service buys.
 *
 * Hand-built rather than reached for from the lucide set, which has
 * nothing close enough - and a reward card wants a mark somebody
 * recognises across a counter rather than a generic outline.
 *
 * The paths carry no fill of their own, so the currentColor on the root
 * is what colours it - which is what lets it sit in the same class list
 * as every lucide icon around it and take its colour from the card.
 */
